    {
      "text": "Ribosomal RNA comparisons helped Carl Woese and colleagues distinguish Archaea as a separate evolutionary lineage.",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10965645/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Archaea occur in many habitats; extreme heat, cold, or salinity is characteristic of some, not all, members of the domain.",
